WEBVTT

00:00:00.660 --> 00:00:01.110
Hello.

00:00:01.540 --> 00:00:05.630
Would you like to get your nails, lashes or hair done without phoning

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:06.950
around for a free time?

00:00:07.460 --> 00:00:12.790
In this lesson, I'll show you how to find a salon and book on Vara

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:13.350
AI.

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:15.270
It takes about a minute.

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:18.950
It's completely free and you can book at any hour,

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:20.470
even at midnight.

00:00:21.304 --> 00:00:23.354
Step 1 Find a salon

00:00:23.784 --> 00:00:26.154
open varaai.com

00:00:26.504 --> 00:00:28.874
in the box service or salon.

00:00:29.064 --> 00:00:31.274
Type what you need for example

00:00:31.704 --> 00:00:32.474
nails

00:00:32.904 --> 00:00:38.954
in the area box, type your city or tap near me to search around where

00:00:38.904 --> 00:00:39.434
you are.

00:00:39.864 --> 00:00:41.514
Then tap search.

00:00:42.024 --> 00:00:46.074
You can also scroll down and pick from browse by category.

00:00:46.830 --> 00:00:51.600
The results show matching salons with their rating and lowest price.

00:00:51.950 --> 00:00:54.800
You can view them as a list or on a map.

00:00:55.390 --> 00:00:58.080
Tap the salon you like to open its page.

00:00:58.670 --> 00:01:00.080
There you'll find the address,

00:01:00.590 --> 00:01:01.520
the phone number

00:01:01.870 --> 00:01:02.720
and three

00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:04.320
services,

00:01:04.990 --> 00:01:05.760
reviews

00:01:06.110 --> 00:01:07.440
and opening hours.

00:01:08.283 --> 00:01:08.973
Step two

00:01:09.483 --> 00:01:10.573
Choose a service.

00:01:11.403 --> 00:01:15.373
Each service shows how long it takes and what it costs.

00:01:15.883 --> 00:01:18.413
Tap book next to the one you want

00:01:19.003 --> 00:01:21.213
to have several services in one visit.

00:01:21.483 --> 00:01:22.973
Tick each of them first.

00:01:23.808 --> 00:01:24.578
Step three

00:01:25.008 --> 00:01:26.098
choose who

00:01:26.528 --> 00:01:27.378
and when

00:01:27.888 --> 00:01:32.498
Under Choose Staff, pick the person you know or leave it on

00:01:32.848 --> 00:01:34.818
any available staff'

00:01:35.248 --> 00:01:38.178
under select date, tap the day you want.

00:01:38.848 --> 00:01:43.218
Select time, then shows the free times grouped into morning,

00:01:43.728 --> 00:01:45.618
afternoon and evening.

00:01:46.128 --> 00:01:47.938
Tap the time that suits you.

00:01:48.629 --> 00:01:49.399
Step 4

00:01:50.149 --> 00:01:50.999
details

00:01:51.509 --> 00:01:55.879
if you don't have an account yet, enter your full name, phone number,

00:01:56.389 --> 00:01:58.679
email and a password.

00:01:59.189 --> 00:02:01.399
Your account is created for you

00:02:01.749 --> 00:02:03.159
if you already have one.

00:02:03.269 --> 00:02:04.759
Tapsign in

00:02:05.189 --> 00:02:07.079
under Choose a payment method.

00:02:07.269 --> 00:02:11.719
It's usually pay at the salon, so you pay after your treatment.

00:02:12.389 --> 00:02:14.279
You can add a note for the salon

00:02:14.649 --> 00:02:18.499
and if you have a discount code or a gift card, type it into the

00:02:18.449 --> 00:02:21.339
discount code box and tap apply.

00:02:22.228 --> 00:02:24.278
Last step. Check the box.

00:02:24.308 --> 00:02:28.438
Your appointment, the right service, the right date and time

00:02:28.788 --> 00:02:29.798
and the price.

00:02:30.308 --> 00:02:30.918
Tick.

00:02:31.428 --> 00:02:34.518
I accept the cancellation policy and terms of use.

00:02:34.788 --> 00:02:36.918
And tap Confirm booking.

00:02:37.907 --> 00:02:42.118
The screen confirms your booking and you get a confirmation email.

00:02:42.949 --> 00:02:46.199
Afterwards, open my bookings to see your appointment.

00:02:46.549 --> 00:02:49.799
If something comes up, you can cancel it there yourself.

00:02:49.829 --> 00:02:53.239
As long as you are within the salon's cancellation deadline.

00:02:53.829 --> 00:02:54.599
That's it.

00:02:55.109 --> 00:02:58.039
Take the quick quiz below to earn your points.
